<title>USA: New Hampton, Iowa, won by Piper Jaffray.</title>
<headline>New Hampton, Iowa, won by Piper Jaffray.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Piper Jaffray said it won $2 million of New Hampton, Iowa, electric revenue bonds, with a true interest cost of 4.906 percent.</p>
</text>
